@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

GET {{API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
### Registro
# @name register
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "alvaro@test.com",
  "username": "alvaro123",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "emailOrUsername": "alvaro123",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Refresh (usa el refreshToken del login)
# @name refresh
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (requiere el accessToken del refresh, y revoca el refreshToken del refresh)
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.$.accessToken}}
{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Prueba: reusar el refreshToken original del login (ya rotado) -> debe dar 401 AUTH_TOKEN_EXPIRED
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### Prueba: logout sin token -> debe dar 401 AUTH_UNAUTHORIZED con el formato correcto
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "cualquier-cosa"
}